{
  "name": "Cognee nightly memory promotion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule",
      "name": "Every 24 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -620,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "session",
        "operation": "getMany",
        "sessionRange": "24h",
        "sessionLimit": 500
      },
      "id": "sessions",
      "name": "Sessions Active Today",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cognee.cognee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "cogneeApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_COGNEE_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "Cognee API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "session_id",
              "renameField": true,
              "outputFieldName": "session_ids"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "collect",
      "name": "Collect Session IDs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-sessions",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.session_ids ?? []).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "any",
      "name": "Any Sessions?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "memory",
        "operation": "improve",
        "improveSessionIds": "={{ $json.session_ids }}",
        "improveDatasetName": "main_dataset",
        "improveAdditionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "improve",
      "name": "Promote Sessions Into Graph",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cognee.cognee",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        360,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "cogneeApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_COGNEE_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "Cognee API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cognee nightly memory promotion\n\nOnce a day, every session that was active in the last 24 hours is promoted into the knowledge graph (`POST /api/v1/improve`). Improve is idempotent per session, so re-submitting a session only processes the turns added since the last run.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Select your Cognee API credential on both Cognee nodes.\n2. Set **Dataset Name** on *Promote Sessions Into Graph* to the dataset your Cognee Memory sub-nodes write to (their *Dataset Name* option, `main_dataset` by default).\n3. Activate the workflow.\n\nPair this with the **Cognee Memory** sub-node's *Promote To Graph* option: keep its default interval for a safety net, or set it to *Never* and let this workflow do all promotion at a fixed hour.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -520
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 24 Hours": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sessions Active Today",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Sessions Active Today": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Collect Session IDs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect Session IDs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Any Sessions?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Any Sessions?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Promote Sessions Into Graph",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false
}
